        "main_content": [
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Solutions Proof of Scale Company Contact Us Ailoitte is an AI-Native Engineering Partner that delivers fixed-price, outcome-based software development for startups, enterprises, and regulated industries. The company does not operate as a traditional hourly billing or staff augmentation firm. Ailoitte uses AI Velocity Pods that combine senior software architects, governed AI development workflows, and Agentic QA automation to deliver production-ready software faster with predictable outcomes. Core capabilities include mobile app development, enterprise web platform development, AI-powered healthcare workflows, frontline hiring automation, retail and eCommerce automation, legacy modernization, startup MVP delivery, and secure enterprise software engineering. Ailoitte emphasizes zero-retention data handling, OWASP-aligned security practices, governed code generation, and human oversight for quality and compliance. Engineering the Future of AI Stop paying for hours. Start scaling outcomes. We replace traditional agency bloat with AI Velocity Pods . Predictable delivery, elite engineering, and outcome-based pricing for visionaries."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See the Case Studies 50M+ Downloads"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Active Customers"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "100%"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Compliance rate"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Satisfied customers"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Heart Rate &amp; HRV Accuracy"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "The &quot;Billable Hour&quot; is a Tax on Speed."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Most agencies profit when your project takes longer. We profit when you ship faster. We&#x27;ve eliminated the friction of manual dev cycles."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Agency Model Bloated teams, endless meetings, and misaligned incentives that punish efficiency."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "AI-First Velocity Small elite pods using agentic workflows to deliver 3x the output at a fixed price."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Time to Value"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Ailoitte Velocity Pod 38 Days 68% FASTER SHIP TIME Choose Your Path to Velocity Whether you need to ship a complex product or automate your internal engine, we have a specialized AI-first model ready."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "For Engineering Teams AI Velocity Pods"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Stop the talent search. We embed elite AI-powered pods into your workflow to ship mission-critical features in weeks, not months."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "300% Boost in Sprint Velocity Automated Agentic QA cycles Clean-code generation (Cursor Native) Hire a Velocity Pod For Operations Outcome-Based AI Agents"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Replace fragmented manual tasks with autonomous AI agents. We build the &quot;Brain&quot; of your operations to handle complex decision-making."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "90% Reduction in manual processing HIPAA/GDPR Compliant LLM flows Integration with existing CRM/ERP Automate My Workflows What Our Pods Build AI-Native Engineering. Enterprise-Ready Architecture."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Mobile App Development High-fidelity Flutter &amp; Riverpod architectures. We build native experiences with AI-accelerated UI/UX workflows for 3x faster go-to-market."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Enterprise Web Platforms"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Full-stack MERN dashboards with real-time data streaming and robust multi-tenant security."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Agentic QA &amp; Security Autonomous agents that penetration test and perform regression on every commit."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Legacy Modernization We refactor monolithic debt into clean, event-driven microservices. Our LLM-assisted migration toolkit ensures 0% downtime and 100% logic parity."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Microservices Our Legacy Proof of Scale Before we built our AI factory, we architected the platforms for some of the fastest-growing enterprises..."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Powering India’s Frontline Hiring at Massive Scale"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "A mobile-first job platform built for 50M+ users, multilingual access, and faster hiring across India’s workforce."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Assurecare Connected Care Platform for 53M+ Members Ailoitte helped power AssureCare’s patient-centered platform that connects payors, providers, and pharmacies to improve access, reduce cost, and strengthen care coordination."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Dr Morepen 1M+ Customers, 40+ Years of Trust We helped Dr. Morepen bring trusted preventive healthcare into a seamless mobile experience with reorders, subscriptions, and health tools."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Lifelong Powering Smart Everyday Commerce for 10M+ Indian Homes A secure, scalable mobile app built to deliver smooth shopping, trusted payments, loyalty features, and high-performance commerce for a growing range of 300+ everyday products."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "BankSathi Driving Financial Inclusion at National Scale A high-performance finance platform built to help 200K+ advisors earn, distribute financial products seamlessly, and serve users across India with trusted banking and NBFC partnerships."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Sanskritly Making Sanskrit Learning Simple, Structured, and Engaging A modern learning platform built to turn a deeply academic language into an intuitive digital experience for learners through clear lessons, thoughtful design, and accessible learning flows."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "View All 50+ Deployed Platforms Logistics Healthcare Retail Unfair Advantage Route Optimization &amp; Predictive Fleets We build custom logistics platforms that leverage predictive AI to reduce fuel consumption by 15% and improve delivery windows. Our engineering focuses on real-time data ingestion and heavy geospatial computation."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Real Stories. Real Success."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&quot; It&#x27;s fair to say that we didn’t just find a development company, but we found a team and that feeling for us is a bit unique. The experience we have here is on a whole new level. &quot;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Lars Tegelaars"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Founder &amp; CEO @Mana"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&quot; Ailoitte understood our requirements immediately and built the team we wanted. On time and budget. Highly recommend working with them for a fruitful collaboration. &quot;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Priyank Mehta"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Head of product, Apna"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&quot; Although Banksathi looked profitable on paper, it faced several execution issues like app glitches, non-functional modules, and slow payment disbursement. To fix this, we analyzed each user journey and addressed the key technical gaps. &quot;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Jitendra Dhaka"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "CEO, Banksathi"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&quot; Working with Ailoitte was a game-changer. They understood our vision of putting “Health in Your Hands” and delivered a beautifully designed, intuitive app. The team was proactive, skilled, and aligned with our mission throughout the project. &quot;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Saurabh Arora"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Director, Dr.Morepen"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&quot; Working with Ailoitte was a game-changer. They brought our vision for Reveza to life with seamless AI integration and a user-friendly experience, boosting in-store engagement by 25%. &quot;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Manikanth Epari"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Co-Founder, Reveza"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&quot; Working with Ailoitte was highly professional and collaborative. The team was responsive, transparent, and proactive, delivering the core requirements effectively while providing valuable architectural suggestions for voice-recognition workflows that improved performance and scalability. &quot;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Ajay gopinath"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "CEO, Sanskritly"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "1 of 6 Frequently Asked Questions What does Ailoitte mean by AI-native engineering? AI-native engineering means we do not use AI as a side tool after planning is complete. We design delivery around AI from the start, combining senior architects, governed AI workflows, automated QA, and strong human checkpoints to ship software faster without losing control."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "What kinds of products does Ailoitte build?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Ailoitte builds mobile apps, web platforms, AI-powered workflows, internal business systems, healthcare software, hiring automation tools, and modernization solutions for legacy systems. Our focus is on production-ready software that drives measurable business outcomes."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "How is Ailoitte different from traditional development agencies?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Traditional agencies often bill by hours and team size. Ailoitte focuses on fixed outcomes, governed delivery, faster execution, and predictable quality. Instead of selling effort, we structure delivery around milestones, speed, compliance, and business impact."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Is Ailoitte a fit for startups or enterprises?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Both. Startups usually work with us for MVPs, faster validation, and lean delivery. Enterprises work with us for secure engineering, modernization, AI adoption, and compliance-focused implementation. The delivery model is adapted to the stage and complexity of the business."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "How quickly can you start?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Project timelines depend on scope, but many engagements start with a short assessment, roadmap, or audit. From there, we define a fixed outcome and delivery path so teams can move quickly without spending months in pre-project planning."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Ready to escape the billable hour trap?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Join the elite tech teams scaling outcomes with AI-First Engineering. We only take 3 new partners per quarter to maintain velocity."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Hire a Velocity Pod Only 2 spots left for Q1 Recognized Leaders Top Innovative AI Companies 2025"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Most Trusted IT Service provider 2024"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "The Best Software Development Company 2025"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Top 10 CEOs Share Their Vision for Success"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "ISO 27001:2013 Information Security"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Enterprises scale teams faster"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Smarter Enterprises with Custom AI"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Ailoitte is an AI-Native Engineering Partner that replaced the billable hour with guaranteed outcomes. We deploy AI-augmented Velocity Pods to ship secure, enterprise-grade mobile and web software 5x faster."
          },
          {
